: [{"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"type": "pdf", "content": "engenn5le02ob08re7pdf01.pdf"}]}], "id": 0, "responses": [{"correct": 1, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "selected": 0, "id": 0}]}], "stimuli_ids": [], "id": 11, "type": "DWS", "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " Research a historical event in another town, city or country."}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Take Away"}]}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}]}}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"type": "skill", "content": "Reading"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Writing"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Speaking"}]}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self Assessment."}]}], "template_override": 1}], "id": 0, "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "id": 0, "contents": [{}]}, {"id": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn5le02ob08re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn5le02ob08re2img01.jpg", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn5le02ob08re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "In November 1917, a communist government came to power in Russia. Its leader, Lenin was very popular with workers with slogans like, \u201cPeace, bread and land\u201d.", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn5le02ob08re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "His time in prison for his beliefs made him a legitimate leader of the average worker. First, Lenin promised the people of Russia that he would take Russia out of World War I.", "id": 2, "time": "12000", "image": "engenn5le02ob08re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "He also said he would give land to the peasants. Finally, he ordered that Soviets and workers would control the factories.", "id": 3, "time": "23000", "image": "engenn5le02ob08re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "The support for Lenin grew in a country that had been controlled by Tsars and outsiders. Overall, they believed that under communist leadership, the lives of the Russian people would be easier.", "id": 4, "time": "31500", "image": "engenn5le02ob08re2img01.jpg"}]}}]}, {"id": 2, "type": "video", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "video", "value": {"video_src": "engenn5le02ob08re3vid01", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": ""}, {"text": "<span class = \"bullet\">How do you write about history?</span>", "id": 1, "time": "1", "image": ""}, {"text": "<span class = \"bullet\">Excerpt</span>", "id": 2, "time": "49000", "image": ""}]}}]}]}], "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Sally in Russia"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "A Historical Stroll"}, {"type": "position", "content": 8}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 2}, {"type": "level", "content": "A2.2"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Accurately use information about people's jobs and places of work in communicative situations."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Writes a brief text about the advantages and disadvantages of specific forms of communication through the appropriate use of grammar, vocabulary, syntaxes and spelling aspects related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Writes a brief text about the advantages and disadvantages of specific forms of communication through the appropriate use of grammar, vocabulary, syntaxes and spelling aspects related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Writes a brief text about the advantages and disadvantages of specific forms of communication through the appropriate use of grammar, vocabulary, syntaxes and spelling aspects related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Writes a brief text about the advantages and disadvantages of specific forms of communication through the appropriate use of grammar, vocabulary, syntaxes and spelling aspects related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Writes a brief text about the advantages and disadvantages of specific forms of communication through the appropriate use of grammar, vocabulary, syntaxes and spelling aspects related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Writes a brief text about the advantages and disadvantages of specific forms of communication through the appropriate use of grammar, vocabulary, syntaxes and spelling aspects related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Writing About History"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "Writing about history requires you to include a lot of details and historical information. Writing about history shows your writing skills and your understanding of information."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<ol> <li>Research information about a topic. Use more than one source.</li> <li>Stay on topic. When you write about history, include events and issues, not descriptions.</li> <li>Include the important details.</li> <li>Do not include your opinion. The paragraph is on history not your opinion of it.</li> <li>Write in chronological order.</li> <li>Write in the Past tense.</li> </ol>"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "communist"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a person who believes in communism or is a member of a political party that supports communism"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The communist party came to power in 1917."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le02ob08aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use to write a paragraph about events in history."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "slogan"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a word or phrase that is easy to remember and is used by a group to attract attention"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Lenin's slogans were popular with workers."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le02ob08aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "legitimate"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "real, accepted, or official"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: They believed Lenin was the legitimate leader of the workers in the Soviet Union."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le02ob08aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "peasant"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a poor farmer or farm worker"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: He also said he would give land to the peasants."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le02ob08aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "Soviet"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "person from the former U.S.S.R."}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: He ordered that Soviets and workers would control the factories."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le02ob08aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "factory"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a building or group of buildings where products are made"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: There is a factory in that small town."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le02ob08aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "outsider"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a person who does not belong to or is not accepted into a particular group or organization"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The support for Lenin grew in a country that had been controlled by Tsars and outsiders."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le02ob08aud07"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn5le02ob08re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Go online and research and interesting festival or cultural celebration."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write a paragraph."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Use the Past Simple tense."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read your paragraph to a partner or family member."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I research festivals and cultural celebrations."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write a paragraph."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I use the Simple Past tense."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I read the paragraph aloud."}]}], "type": "sena"}